{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁלָם","hw":"שְׁלָם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁלָם</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong><a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:31\" href=\"/Daniel.3.31\">Dn 3:31</a> <strong>welfare, prosperity</strong>;—in greetings: abs. <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:17\" href=\"/Ezra.4.17\">Ezr 4:17</a> <em>prosperity!</em> emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁלָמָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:7\" href=\"/Ezra.5.7\">5:7</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁלָֽמְכוֹן יַשְׂגִּיא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:31\" href=\"/Daniel.3.31\">Dn 3:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:26\" href=\"/Daniel.6.26\">6:26</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, שֻׁם","prev":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁלֵם"}